        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Grievances under the, Extended Compensation Option, shall be limited to disputes and appropriate remedies regarding the selection or non-selection of an Lucent Technologies employee participating in JMC for a JMC assignment, and questions relating to work rules, for which the collective bargaining agreement covering the temporary position to which the employee is assigned shall be controlling.",
