            "block_content": "(1) It is further understood that when an employee who is participating in the Extended Compensation Option is not assigned to a JMC assignment, the provisions of the applicable collective bargaining agreement for the position held by the employee immediately prior to assignment to the JMC shall apply to those matters not directly related to the employee's participation in the Extended Compensation Option.",
